Data files
========

Reference data used by bin/cefr_bands.py.

These are data, not code.  The project LICENSE (MIT) covers the source code.  It does not cover every file in this directory.  Each file below records its own origin and terms.


en_50k.txt
---------------

The 50,000 most frequent English words, with a count for each.  One word per line, in the format {word}{space}{count}, most frequent first.

cefr_bands.py uses this as its reference.  Your manuscript's vocabulary is banded against these ranks.


Source

        hermitdave/FrequencyWords, file content/2018/en/en_50k.txt

        https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords
        https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords/master/content/2018/en/en_50k.txt


Retrieved

